The chair decision for cycle 1 is written to `runs/Absolute_2026-09-27_04/decisions/cycle-001/decision.json`.

All three proposals named the same change, and the research matrix shows `dimension_error_m` is the largest term in the baseline (3.0 of `scenario_error` 4.752). The chosen change is one feature, `face-extent-dimensions`: publish the camera-frame extent of the valid face points as `has_dimensions`, `width_m`, `height_m`, and `depth_m` on `EstimatePoseOutcome`.
